{"id":"e2657e44f434ef2b","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md","title":"ZFC Rank Of Tree","display":"df-zfc-rank-of-tree — ZFC Rank Of Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-rank-of-tree — ZFC Rank Of Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rank-of-tree — ZFC Rank Of Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,T,A\\in V\">\\(\\rho,T,A\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the finite-sequence set defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequences}\\vdash A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequences}\\vdash A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T) \\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\;\\left(T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(t)\\;(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\in A^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)=T\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(s))\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\left(\\rho(s)=\\sup\\{\\rho(t)+1:t\\in T\\land s\\subsetneq t\\}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T) \\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\;\\left(T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(t)\\;(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\in A^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)=T\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(s))\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\left(\\rho(s)=\\sup\\{\\rho(t)+1:t\\in T\\land s\\subsetneq t\\}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>序数值树秩只对无穷分支不存在的良基树定义；前缀闭合与良基性现已显式包含。</li>\n<li>终端节点的上确界为空集，故其秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the predicate from [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho,T,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequences}\\vdash A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T) \\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\;\\left(T\\subseteq A^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(t)\\;(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\in A^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)=T\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(s))\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\left(\\rho(s)=\\sup\\{\\rho(t)+1:t\\in T\\land s\\subsetneq t\\}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"5dd0bb3454409e5e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S$ 